rable cushion and flexibility to the Vertebral Column</p>',3,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 06:51:19',NULL,NULL),(15106,3629,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Anulus</em></strong><em> </em>(L. n.), classically, <em>small ring”</em>; </p><p>diminutive of <strong><em>Anus</em></strong> (L. n.), ring;</p><p>Metaphor for the outer rim of the Intervertebral Disc </p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>',4,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 06:51:35',NULL,NULL),(15107,3629,12,NULL,'<p>ANUS – DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p><p><u>AN</u>AL CANAL – DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p><p><u>AN</u>AL SPHINCTER M. – DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p><p><u>AN</u>AL TRIANGLE – DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p><p><u>ANI</u>, (LEVATOR___M.) </p><p>PERI<u>NEI</u>, (TRANSVERSUS___ SUPERFICIALIS M.) </p>',5,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 06:52:12',44,'2024-12-11 06:52:35'),(15108,3630,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Radial Ligament</strong></p><p>Wraps around radial head</p>',2,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 06:53:47',NULL,NULL),(15109,3630,13,NULL,'<p>Provides pivotal rotation of the Radial head on the Capitulum of Distal Humerus during Pronation and Supination of the forearms,&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 06:54:02',NULL,NULL),(15110,3630,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Anulus</em></strong><em> </em>(L. n.), classically, <em>small ring”</em>; </p><p>diminutive of <strong><em>Anus</em></strong> (L. n.), ring;</p><p>Metaphor for the outer rim of the Intervertebral Disc&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 06:54:15',NULL,NULL),(15112,3630,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Anular</em></strong>,</p><p>metaphorically, <em>“small ring”</em></p><p><br></p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Anul- + -ar</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Anulus </em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-ar</em></strong>, suffix, forms adj.</p>',5,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 06:55:06',NULL,NULL),(15113,3630,12,NULL,'<p>ANUS – DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p><p><u>AN</u>AL CANAL – DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p><p><u>AN</u>AL SPHINCTER M. – DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p><p><u>AN</u>AL TRIANGLE – DIGESTIVE SYST