</p>',3,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:46:53',NULL,NULL),(15157,3643,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Dental</strong></p><p>Figuratively, “<em>tooth-like”</em>, Odontoid Process of C2</p>',2,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:52:25',44,'2024-12-12 08:58:40'),(15158,3643,13,NULL,'<p>Articulation between the Foramen of C1 and the Odontoid Process of C2&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:54:09',NULL,NULL),(15159,3643,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Atlanto-</em></strong><em> derived from </em><strong><em>Atlas</em></strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>(Gr. Mythology), Mythic muscular male that carries the world on his shoulder;</p><p>Metaphor for C1 supporting the Cranium resting on the Lateral Masses</p>',4,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:54:22',NULL,NULL),(15160,3644,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Surface</strong></p><p>Flat ear-shaped surface for articulation&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:55:52',44,'2024-12-12 08:59:35'),(15161,3644,13,NULL,'<p>Bilateral surfaces, with-ear like outlines, of Sacrum that articulate with the Ilium of <strong><em>Os Coxae</em></strong> (Pelvis)</p>',2,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:56:10',NULL,NULL),(15162,3644,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Auriculus</em></strong> (L. n.), figuratively, <em>“small ear”</em></p>',3,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:56:23',NULL,NULL),(15163,3644,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Auricular</em></strong>, </p><p>figuratively, <em>“ear-shaped” </em>surface for articulation</p><p><br></p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Auriculus + -ar</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Auriculus</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ar</em></strong>, suffix, forms adj.</p>',4,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:56:38',NULL,NULL),(15164,3644,12,NULL,'<p>	AURICLES - EARS</p><p>AURICLE – NERVOUS SYSTEM</p><p>AURICLE, CARDIAC – CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM</p><p>	<u>AURICUL</u>ARIS, (ANTERIORIS___M.) </p><p>	<u>AURICUL</u>ARIS, (POSTERIORIS___M.) </p><p>	<u>AURICUL</u>ARIS, (SUPERIORIS___M.)</p>',5,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 07:57:19',NULL,NULL