t</p>',1,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 08:23:49',NULL,NULL),(15180,3650,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Bursa</em> </strong>(L. n.; plu., <strong><em>Bursae</em></strong>), “<em>leather purse, pouch</em>”</p><p>Metaphor for the “<em>pocket”</em> joint cushion&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 08:24:01',NULL,NULL),(15181,3650,9,NULL,'<p>comp., <strong><em><u>Bursa + -itis</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bursa</em> </strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-itis</em></strong>, denotes inflammatory condition</p>',3,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 08:24:13',NULL,NULL),(15182,3650,12,NULL,'<p>BURSA, OMENTAL</p>',4,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 08:24:35',NULL,NULL),(15183,3651,13,NULL,'<p>  1 of 8 Carpal Bones: <strong><em>Capitate, Lunate, Hamate, Pisiform, Scaphoid, Trapezium, Trapezoid, Triquetrum</em>; </strong>each articulation are miniature synovial sliding joints:</p><p>  </p>',1,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 08:33:12',NULL,NULL),(15184,3651,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Caput </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Capites</em></strong>), head</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 08:33:30',NULL,NULL),(15185,3651,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Capitate</em></strong>, </p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">figuratively,<strong> </strong><em>“provided with a head”</em>;<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>comp., <u>Capit- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ate</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Capites</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ate</em></strong> (suffix) forms adj., provided with . . .</p>',3,0,NULL,44,'2024-12-11 08:33:49',NULL,NULL),(15186,3651,12,NULL,'<p><u>CAPIT</u>IS – MUSCULAR SYSTEM</p><p><u>CAPIT</u>IS<strong>, </strong>FOVEA- SKELETAL SYSTEM</p><p><u>CAPIT</u>IS, (INTERSPINALES__MM.)</p><p><u>CAPIT</u>IS, (