ong></p><p><strong><em>comp., <u>Anti- + Thrombi- + -in</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Anti</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Thrombi</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-in</em></strong> (suffix), denotes protein, hormone (ex., Insulin)</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:27:48',44,'2025-04-01 01:20:28'),(15939,52,13,NULL,'<p>Enzyme that<strong> </strong>neutralizes presence and action of Antithrombin.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:28:40',NULL,NULL),(15940,52,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Anti</em></strong> (prep.), opposite, against</p><p><strong><em>Thrombus </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Thrombi</em></strong>), classically, “curd of milk”; modern, “blood clot”</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:28:51',44,'2025-04-01 01:23:29'),(15941,52,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>AntiThrombinase,</em></strong></p><p><em>Enzyme neutralizes action of Antithrombin</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><strong><em>comp., <u>Anti- + Thrombi- + -in + -ase</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Anti</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Thrombi</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-in</em></strong> (suffix), denotes protein, hormone (ex., Insulin)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-ase</em></strong>, (suffix), denotes enzyme</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:29:04',44,'2025-04-01 01:22:27'),(15942,53,13,NULL,'<p>Largest Artery originating from the left Ventricle; Aorta is histologically continuous with the heart extending to the lower abdomen</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:29:57',NULL,NULL),(15943,53,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Aorta </em></strong><em>derived from </em><strong><em>Aortos</em></strong> (Gr. n.), the great artery</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:30:07',NULL,NULL),(15944,57,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Aortic</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:32:14',16,'2025-04-26 07:11:33'),(15947,57,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Arch</strong></p><p>Arterial tissue related to left Ventricle curves up, then curves down</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:33:05',NULL,NULL),(15948,57,13,NULL,'<p>The aortic arch branches off into 3 outlets: <u>Brachiocephalic Artery</u> to carry blood to the head; left <u>Common Carotid</u> artery to the brain; left <u>Subclavian</u> artery to the upper extremities.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:33:15',44,'2025-04-01 01:26:59'),(15949,57,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Aorta </em></strong><em>derived from </em><strong><em>Aortos</em></strong> (Gr. n.), the great artery</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:33:22',NULL,NULL),(15950,58,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Aortic&nbsp;</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:36:06',16,'2025-04-26 07:11:12'),(15951,58,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Bodies,</strong></p><p>Sensor Entities that distributed around the aorta</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:36:17',NULL,NULL),(15952,58,13,NULL,'<p>The aortic bodies are Chemoreceptor sensors located adjacent to the Aorta via sensory Vagus Nerve (CN X)</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:36:24',44,'2025-04-01 01:29:33'),(15953,58,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Aorta </em></strong><em>derived from </em><strong><em>Aortos</em></strong> (Gr. n.), the great artery</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:36:30',NULL,NULL),(15954,59,15,NULL,'<p><strong>﻿Aortic&nbsp;</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:36:58',44,'2025-04-01 01:30:21'),(15955,59,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Reflex</strong></p><p>Feedback apparatus for autonomic responses</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:37:10',NULL,NULL),(15956,59,13,NULL,'<p>The aortic reflex are controlled by a highly sensitive Baroreceptors in this segment of Aorta to control blood pressure to the head, brain, and the upper extremities.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:37:21',44,'2025-04-01 01:31:52'),(15957,60,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Aortic&nbsp;</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'202