p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:43:25',16,'2025-04-26 07:09:15'),(15973,65,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Capillaries</strong></p><p>Hair-thin arteries;<em> </em>thinnest of all blood vessels</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:43:32',NULL,NULL),(15974,65,13,NULL,'<p>Bed of fine blood vessels where Arteries and Veins merge (anastomoses); Capillaries are smaller than Arterioles</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:43:41',NULL,NULL),(15975,65,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Arteria</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Arteriae</em></strong>), artery</p><p>classically, “<em>windpipe</em>”</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:43:49',NULL,NULL),(15976,66,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Arterial&nbsp;</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:45:56',16,'2025-04-26 07:06:02'),(15977,66,13,NULL,'<p>Histologically derived from the Aorta; large in diameter and sturdy, made up of elastic fibrous tissue, equipped with smooth muscles to provide resilience to pressure from Ventricular ejection pressure and circulate blood throughout the Vascular System.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:46:03',NULL,NULL),(15978,66,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Arteria</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Arteriae</em></strong>), artery</p><p>classically, “<em>windpipe</em>”</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:46:11',NULL,NULL),(15979,71,13,NULL,'<p>Transition arteries between small arteries and capillaries&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:50:54',16,'2025-04-26 07:08:35'),(15980,71,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Arteriolus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Arterioli</em></strong>), small artery;</p><p>diminutive form of<strong><em> Arteria</em></strong>, classically, “<em>windpipe</em>”</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:51:02',44,'2025-04-01 01:43:20'),(15981,74,13,NULL,'<p>Hardening of the arteries, becoming less elastic; worsens with aging.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 02:52:10',16,'2025-04-26 07:07:37'),(15982,74,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Arteria</em></strong> (L. n.), artery; classically, “<em>windpipe</em>”</p><p><strong><em>Sclera </em></strong>(L. n.), hardening</p>',