>, “</em></strong><em>hardening oatmeal in milk/water</em>”</p><p>for calcified arteries; as seen x-ray signs</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Atheros </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>Scler- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-osis</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Atheros</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Sclera</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-osis</em></strong> (suffix), denotes pathology</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 03:02:25',44,'2025-04-01 01:59:05'),(16000,79,13,NULL,'<p>Two entrance chambers into the heart: blood enters the right Atrium from Vena Cavas, superior and inferior; blood enters left Atrium from the lungs via the Pulmonary Veins.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 03:03:01',44,'2025-04-01 02:02:27'),(16001,79,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Atrium</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Atria</em></strong>), classically, open air part of roof</p><p>of Roman villa, for rainwater collection</p><p>metaphor for blood pouring into the Atria</p><p>from Vena Cava and Pulmonary Veins</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 03:03:09',44,'2025-04-01 02:04:30'),(16002,80,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Atrial&nbsp;</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 03:03:37',44,'2025-04-01 02:05:26'),(16003,80,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Natriuretic,</strong></p><p><u>Na- + Urea</u></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 03:03:45',NULL,NULL),(16004,80,13,NULL,'<p>When the Atria is stretched due to abnormally increased venous return, the Atria release ANH to control venous return via reduced blood volume by Na­- elimination and increased urine production.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 03:03:53',NULL,NULL),(16005,80,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Atrium</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Atria</em></strong>), open air part of roof</p><p>of Roman villa, for rainwater collection;</p><p>metaphor for blood pouring into the Atria</p><p>from Vena Cava and Pulmonary Veins</p>',4,0,NULL,1