-align-justify\">comp., <strong><em><u>Circum </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>Flex</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Circum</em></strong> </p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Flexum&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><br></p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:02:51',NULL,NULL),(16183,136,13,NULL,'<p>Congealed blood at the site of injury which is naturally, innately “<em>formulated</em>” in the blood plasma when triggered by an injury.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:04:00',NULL,NULL),(16184,136,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Coagulare </em></strong>(L. v.), to congeal from liquid; </p><p><strong><em>Coagulatum </em></strong>(past part.), congealed&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:04:11',NULL,NULL),(16185,137,13,NULL,'<p>Coagulation is a process inherent in the blood plasma when triggered by a wound; blood congeals at the site of injury to halt bleeding</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:04:34',NULL,NULL),(16186,137,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Coagulare </em></strong>(L. v.), to congeal from liquid; </p><p><strong><em>Coagulatum </em></strong>(past part.), congealed&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:04:44',NULL,NULL),(16187,137,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Coagulation,</em></strong></p><p><em>figuratively, “congealing</em>”<em> </em>from liquid to solid</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>comp., <em><u>Coagulat- </u></em><u>+ </u><em><u>-ion</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Coagulatum </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ion </em></strong>(suffix), forms noun of action</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:04:52',44,'2025-04-01 03:42:08'),(16188,138,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Coagulation</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:06:08',44,'2025-04-01 03:42:37'),(16189,138,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Factors,</strong></p><p>“innate” factors in the blood plasma 