ricles has been restored.&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:48:58',NULL,NULL),(16263,158,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Diastole</em></strong> (Gr. n.), dilation</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:49:04',NULL,NULL),(16264,158,9,NULL,'<p>comp., <strong><em><u>Diastole + -ic</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Diastole</em></strong> </p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-ic </em></strong>(suffix), forms adj.; ability</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:49:12',NULL,NULL),(16265,159,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Dicrotic</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:50:00',16,'2025-04-26 06:21:00'),(16266,159,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Notch,</strong></p><p>An interruption of a heart soundwave of the ventricular contraction&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:50:11',NULL,NULL),(16267,159,13,NULL,'<p>the dub of lub-dub heart sound; second faint pulse created by the recoil of the Aorta when the semilunar valve snap closes.&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:50:19',NULL,NULL),(16268,159,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Dicroticus, -a, -um</em></strong> (L. adj.), rattling noise,</p><p>metaphorically, “<em>double drumbeat</em>” of the heart</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:50:26',NULL,NULL),(16269,160,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Differential</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:51:05',44,'2025-04-02 01:01:30'),(16270,160,13,NULL,'<p>Percentages distributed among the five types of WBC, totalling 100%; departure off the normal distribution indicates certain pathologies.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 05:51:19',NULL,NULL),(16271,161,13,NULL,'<p>Red Blood Cells function for Capillary Exchange of nutrients/O2, with waste products/CO2 accumulated in the interstitial tissue by means of Concentration Gradient and selective Permeability.&nbsp;</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:03:14',NULL,NULL),(16272,161,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Diffidere </em></strong>(L. v.), to spread out, pour out;</p><p><strong><em>Diffusum </em></strong>(past part.), poured around&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:03:27',NULL,NULL),(16274,161,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Diffusion</em></strong></p><p>Metaphorically, distributed by “<em>pouring around</em>”</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Diffus- + -ion</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Diffusum </em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-ion</em></strong> (suffix), forms noun of action</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:04:24',NULL,NULL),(16275,162,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Digital</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:04:58',16,'2025-04-26 06:20:36'),(16276,162,13,NULL,'<p>Arteries supplying the fingers / toes</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:05:07',NULL,NULL),(16277,162,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Digitus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Digiti</em></strong>), a fingers or toes</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:05:14',NULL,NULL),(16278,163,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Distributing</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:05:52',44,'2025-04-02 01:03:31'),(16279,163,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., MUSCULAR ARTERIES; Medium size arteries, having 25-40 layers of smooth muscles can withstand high pressure from blood volume during ventricular ejection and relentless flow of blood.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:06:00',NULL,NULL),(16280,164,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Dorsal / Dorsalis</strong>, adj.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:07:13',NULL,NULL),(16281,164,13,NULL,'<p>The backside of humans or animals</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:07:21',NULL,NULL),(16282,164,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Dorsum </em></strong>(plu.,<strong><em> Dorsa</em></strong>), backside of humans or animals</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:07:28',44,'2025-04-02 01:04:37'),(16283,165,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Dorsalis</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:08:04',16,'2025-04-26 06:19:57'),(16284,165,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Pedis,</strong></p><p>Translation:<em> “of the foot”</em></p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:08:17',NULL,NULL),(16285,165,13,NULL,'<p>lite