16,'2024-12-16 06:11:37',16,'2025-04-26 06:18:40'),(16293,167,13,NULL,'<p>Metaphorically, the moment of<em> </em>\"<em>casting out</em>” blood; the ventricular pressure during contraction must be high enough to open the valves of the Ventricles in order to eject blood into the Aorta and the Pulmonary arteries.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:11:46',NULL,NULL),(16294,167,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ejectire </em></strong>(L. v.),<strong><em> </em></strong>to hurl, shoot, throw; <strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Ejectum </em></strong>(past part.), thrown, shot&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:11:55',NULL,NULL),(16295,167,9,NULL,'<p>comp., <strong><em><u>Eject- + -ion</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ejectum</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-io(nes)</em></strong> (suffix), forms noun of action</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:12:07',NULL,NULL),(16296,168,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Elastic</strong></p><p><br></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:12:50',44,'2025-04-02 01:09:00'),(16297,168,13,NULL,'<p>The strongest and largest diameter of all arteries are able to withstand internal high pressure due to its resiliency.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:12:57',NULL,NULL),(16298,168,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Elastos / Elatos</em></strong> (Gr. adj.), stretchable</p><p>figuratively, “<em>expandable</em>” artery</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:13:04',NULL,NULL),(16299,169,13,NULL,'<p>Smooth inner surface of the heart chambers, allowing the blood to flow smoothly.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:13:43',16,'2025-04-26 06:18:05'),(16300,169,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Endo</em></strong> (L prep), in, inside, into</p><p><strong><em>Cardium / Kardium</em></strong> (Gr. n.), the heart</p><p>figuratively, “<em>inside the heart</em>”</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:13:51',44,'2025-04-02 01:09:48'),(16301,170,13,NULL,'<p>Peptide released from Endothelial cells lining the blood vessels for contraction of small blood vessels in response to vascular injury.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:18:01',NULL,NULL),(16302,170,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Endo</em></strong> (L. prep), in, inside, into</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Thelium</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Thelia</em></strong>), teat, buds, nipple</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:18:07',NULL,NULL),(16303,170,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>EndoThelin</em></strong></p><p><em>figuratively,</em><strong><em> “</em></strong><em>Hormone from inside lining</em>”</p><p><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">comp., <strong><em><u>Endo + Thelia + </u></em></strong><u>-</u><strong><em><u>in</u></em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Endo</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Thelia</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-in</em></strong> (suffix), denotes protein, hormone (ex., Insulin)</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:18:23',44,'2025-04-02 01:11:10'),(16304,171,13,NULL,'<p>All blood vessels have internal lining of simple epithelial cells, a continuum of endocardium</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:18:53',16,'2025-04-26 06:17:39'),(16305,171,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Endo</em></strong> (L. prep), in, inside, into</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Thelium</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Thelia</em></strong>), teat, buds, nipple</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-16 06:19:04',NULL,NULL),(16306,171,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>EndoThelium</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">figuratively, “<em>rough inside</em>” lining</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">comp., <strong><em><u>Endo + Thelium</u></em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb