 von Willebrand Factor, a protein secreted from the Endothelial Cells in the interior lining of blood vessels.&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:12:10',NULL,NULL),(16693,298,8,NULL,'<p><strong>Platelet </strong>(Eng. n.), small round plate</p><p>Metaphor for the fragments of Megakaryocytes, 3um in diameter,</p><p>Raw materials for blood clot formation</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:12:17',44,'2025-04-07 01:40:47'),(16694,299,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Platelets</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:12:50',44,'2025-04-02 04:00:07'),(16695,299,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Aggregation,</strong></p><p>Platelets coalesce to form a plug for clotting</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:13:01',NULL,NULL),(16696,299,13,NULL,'<p>When bleeding from a cut occurs Fibrinogen attach platelets surface receptors; collectively, platelets form a PLATELETS PLUG that seal the wound, stops the bleeding.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:13:08',NULL,NULL),(16697,299,8,NULL,'<p><strong>Platelet </strong>(Eng. n.), small round plate </p><p>Metaphor for the fragments of Megakaryocytes,</p><p>3um in diameter, Raw materials for blood clot formation</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:14:06',NULL,NULL),(16698,300,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Platelets</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:14:38',44,'2025-04-02 04:00:34'),(16699,300,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Plug,</strong></p><p>platelets stick to each other to form a plug for clotting</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:15:05',44,'2025-04-07 01:42:53'),(16700,300,13,NULL,'<p>When bleeding from a cut occurs Fibrinogen attach platelets surface receptors together, called PLATELETS AGGREGATION, becomes PLATELETS PLUG that seals the wound, stops the bleeding.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:15:19',NULL,NULL),(16701,300,8,NULL,'<p><strong>Platelet </strong>(Eng. n.), small round plate </p><p>Metaphor for the fragments of Megakaryocytes,</p><p>3um in diameter, Raw materials for blood clot formation</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-18 02:15:27',NULL,NULL),(16702,301,15,NULL,'<p><stro