rong>Central</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:43:30',NULL,NULL),(17906,468,13,NULL,'<p>The venous network of the liver Sinusoids collects venous blood into Central Veins and empty into the Hepatic Veins, finally, into the inferior Vena Cava.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:43:36',NULL,NULL),(17907,468,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Centrus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Centri</em></strong>), the center&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:43:42',NULL,NULL),(17908,469,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Cephalic</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:44:10',NULL,NULL),(17909,469,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Phase,</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Classically, <strong><em>Phasis</em></strong> (L. n.), “passing stage of the moon”</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:44:18',16,'2025-04-30 01:29:39'),(17910,469,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., <strong>Cerebral Phase;</strong> Taste, smell, sight, and imaginings of food stimulates the Medulla Oblongata digestive centers and responds by sending action potentials through CN X - Vagus Nerve Parasympathetic fibers to the Enteric Plexus and stimulates secretory activities in the Gastric Pits to produce Gastrin that stimulates the Parietal Cells in the Gastric Glands.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:44:26',NULL,NULL),(17911,469,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Cephalos </em></strong>(Gr. n.), head, brain</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:44:32',16,'2025-04-30 01:30:00'),(17912,469,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Cephalic</em></strong></p><p><em>figuratively,</em><strong><em> “</em></strong><em>brain</em>” phase</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">comp., <strong><em><u>Cephali </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ic</u></em></strong></p><ul><li class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cephalos </em></strong></li><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-ic</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</li></ul>',5,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:44:49',16,'2025-04-30 01:30:46'),(17913,470,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Cerebral</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:45:39',NULL,NULL),(17914,470,7,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>Phase,</strong></p><p>Classically, “passing stage of the moon”</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:45:49',16,'2025-04-30 01:31:20'),(17915,470,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., <strong>Cephalic Phase</strong>; Taste, smell, sight, and imaginings of food stimulates the Medulla Oblongata digestive centers and responds by sending action potentials through CN X - Vagus Nerve Parasympathetic fibers to the Enteric Plexus and stimulates secretory activities in the Gastric Pits to produce Gastrin that stimulates the Parietal Cells in the Gastric Glands.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:45:59',NULL,NULL),(17916,470,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Cerebrum</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Cerebri</em></strong>), brain&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:46:07',NULL,NULL),(17917,470,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Cerebral</em></strong></p><p><em>Figuratively, “it’s all in your</em> <em>head</em>” phase</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">comp.,<strong> <em><u>Cerebr- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-al</u></em></strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Cerebrum</em></strong></li><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-alis</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</li></ul>',5,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:46:16',16,'2025-04-30 01:32:24'),(17918,471,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Chemical</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:46:40',NULL,NULL),(17919,471,13,NULL,'<p>Accomplished by digestive enzymes and Gastric Fluid secreted along the digestive tract; </p><p>they break down the covalent chemical bonds of organic molecules: </p><p>carbohydrates to monosaccharides, protein into amino acids, fats into fatty acids and glycerol.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 00:46:47',4