tion</em></strong></p><p>classical: <em>\"to cleanse of dregs”</em></p><p>poetic old meaning: <em>\"to purify”</em></p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><em>comp., </em><strong><em><u>Defaecat- + -ion</u></em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Defaecatum </em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>-ion</em> </strong>(suffix), forms noun of action.</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:30:55',16,'2025-04-30 02:23:33'),(18008,506,13,NULL,'<p>The swallowing of food, the last voluntary phase of digestive system; thereafter reflexes and Parasympathetic Autonomic Nervous System takes over the digestive processes.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:31:44',NULL,NULL),(18009,506,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Deglutire </em></strong>(L. v.), to swallow; <strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Deglutitum </em></strong>(past part.), swallowed, ingested&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:31:51',NULL,NULL),(18010,506,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">comp., <strong><em><u>Deglutit- + -ion</u></em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Deglutitum</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>-ion</em></strong> (suffix), forms noun of action.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:32:00',16,'2025-04-30 02:00:20'),(18011,507,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Dental</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:32:34',NULL,NULL),(18012,507,13,NULL,'<p>Sets of lower teeth and upper teeth: the Maxillary Arch and the Mandibular Arch</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:32:41',NULL,NULL),(18013,507,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Dens</em></strong> (