ficiency in ADH causes production of large volume of clear, diluted urine, leading to dehydration and depletion of Electrolytes.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:36:59',NULL,NULL),(18032,512,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Dia-</em></strong> (L. prefix), through, across, along</p><p><strong><em>Bainein</em></strong> (Gr. v.), to pass</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:37:07',NULL,NULL),(18033,512,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>DiaBainein (tes)</em></strong></p><p>metaphorically, water <em>“passing through”</em></p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><em>comp.</em><strong><em>, <u>Dia- + Bainein + -tes</u></em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Dia-</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Bainein</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>-tes</em></strong> (Gr. suffix), agent, someone Diabetic</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:37:18',16,'2025-04-30 02:04:17'),(18034,513,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Diabetes</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:38:38',NULL,NULL),(18035,513,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Mellitus,</strong></p><p>Sweetened with honey, sugar</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:38:49',NULL,NULL),(18036,513,13,NULL,'<p>Marked by high volume of urine with high concentration of Glucose due to inability of cells to absorb Glucose from circulation.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:38:56',NULL,NULL),(18037,513,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Dia-</em></strong> (L. prefix), through, across, along</p><p><strong><em>Bainein</em></strong> (Gr. v.), to pass</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:39:05',NULL,NULL),(18038,513,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>DiaBainein (tes)</em></strong></p><p>Metaphorically, <em>“passing through”</em></p><p><em>all sorts of nutrients</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp</em><strong><em>., <u>Dia- + Bainein + -tes</u></em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Dia-</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Bainein</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>-tes</em></strong> (Gr. suffix), agent, someone Diabetic</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:39:20',16,'2025-04-30 02:05:12'),(18039,514,13,NULL,'<p>Loose bowel movements and watery stool caused by inflammation of the large intestine (intestinal bacterial infection); the colon secretes large amount of mucus and electrolytes for water to move into the colon by osmosis; discharge of watery feces drain the bacterial infection.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:41:20',NULL,NULL),(18040,514,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Dia-</em></strong> (L. prefix), through, along</p><p><strong><em>Rrhea</em></strong> (Gr. n.), a flow&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:41:29',NULL,NULL),(18041,514,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>DiaRrhea</em></strong></p><p><em>Figuratively “flow through”</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp.</em><strong><em>, <u>Dia- + Rrhea</u></em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Dia-</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Rrhea</em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:41:43',16,'2025-04-30 02:07:00'),(18042,515,13,NULL,'<p>Breakdown of large food particles into their molecular components (Carbohydrates into monosaccharides, protein into amino acids, triglycerides into fatty acids and glycerol).</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:42:05',NULL,NULL),(18043,515,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Digerere </em></strong>(L. v.), to dissolve, to take apart; <strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em>&nbsp;</e