><strong><em>-ive </em></strong>(suffix), forms adj.; denotes function</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:43:50',16,'2025-04-30 02:08:35'),(18050,519,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Digestive</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:44:10',NULL,NULL),(18051,519,13,NULL,'<p>The alimental journey begins in the mouth, and ends at the anus; along the canal associated organs and glands secrete fluid into the closed tube for masticating, grinding, deglutition, mixing, absorbing, storing and excreting undigested food waste.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:44:18',NULL,NULL),(18052,519,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Digerere </em></strong>(L. v.), to dissolve, to take apart; <strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Digestum </em></strong>(past part.), dissolved&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:44:27',NULL,NULL),(18053,519,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Digestive</em> </strong></p><p><em>figuratively, function to</em><strong><em> </em></strong><em>“dissolve” </em>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Digest- + -ive</u></em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>Digestum</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 246, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\">·            </span><strong><em>-ive </em></strong>(suffix), forms adj.; denotes function</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:44:41',16,'2025-04-30 02:09:42'),(18054,520,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Digestive</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:45:46',NULL,NULL),(18055,520,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., ALIMENTARY CANAL; a tube beginning in the Oral Cavity, Pharynx, Esophagus, Stomach, Small Intestine, Colon, Rectum, Anus and associated digestive organs and digestive secretory glands</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 01:45:55',NULL,NULL),(18056,520,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Digerere </em></strong>(L. v.), to dissolve, to take apart; <strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Digestum 