p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:26:17',44,'2025-04-09 03:28:08'),(18484,660,13,NULL,'<p>One of 3 chewing muscles that closes the jaw; others: Masseter and Buccinator Muscles.</p><p>(LATERAL PTERYGOID MUSCLE opens the mouth)</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:26:24',NULL,NULL),(18485,660,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Medius, -ia, -ium </em></strong>(adj.), middle</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:26:31',NULL,NULL),(18486,661,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Mesenteric</strong>, adj.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:27:00',NULL,NULL),(18487,661,13,NULL,'<p>Connective tissues that attach organs, nerves and blood vessels to the abdominal wall.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:27:06',NULL,NULL),(18488,661,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mesos </em></strong><span style=\"background-color: white;\">(</span>Gr. n.), middle, halfway</p><p><strong><em>Enteros</em></strong> (Gr. n.), the intestine, the bowels</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:27:12',NULL,NULL),(18489,661,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>MesEntery</em></strong></p><p>literally, “<em>the middle of the bowels”</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">&nbsp;</p><p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Mes- + Entery</u></em></strong></p><ul><li><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Mes-</em></strong><em> derived from </em><strong><em>Mesos </em></strong></li><li><strong><em>&nbsp;Enteros</em></strong></li></ul>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:27:22',44,'2025-04-09 03:29:15'),(18490,662,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Mesenteric</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:27:52',NULL,NULL),(18491,662,13,NULL,'<p>Originated from the Abdominal Aorta, supplying oxygenated blood to the surrounding organs.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:27:59',NULL,NULL),(18492,662,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mesos </em></strong><span style=\"background-color: white;\">(</span>Gr. n.), middle, halfway</p><p><strong><em>Enteros</em></strong> (Gr. n.), the intestine, the bowels</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:28:06',NULL,NULL),(18493,662,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>MesEnteric</em></strong></p><p><em>literally, “the middle of the bowels”</em></p><p><