), middle, halfway</p><p><strong><em>Enteros</em></strong> (Gr. n.), the intestine, the bowels</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:35:31',NULL,NULL),(18502,664,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>MesEntery</em></strong></p><p>literally, “<em>the middle of the bowels”</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">&nbsp;</p><p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Mes- + Entery</u></em></strong></p><ul><li><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Mes-</em></strong><em> derived from </em><strong><em>Mesos </em></strong></li><li><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Enteros</em></strong></li></ul>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:35:39',44,'2025-04-09 03:32:44'),(18503,665,13,NULL,'<p>Vermiform Appendix of the large intestine</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:36:03',NULL,NULL),(18504,665,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mesos </em></strong><span style=\"background-color: white;\">(</span>Gr. n.), middle, halfway</p><p><strong><em>Appendix </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Appendices</em></strong>), appendage&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:36:09',NULL,NULL),(18505,665,9,NULL,'<p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Meso- + Appendix</u></em></strong></p><ul><li><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Mesos </em></strong></li><li><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Appendix&nbsp;</em></strong></li></ul>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:36:17',44,'2025-04-09 03:34:21'),(18506,666,13,NULL,'<p>Small droplets of digested fats in the Intestine, emulsified by bile salts available for absorption.&nbsp;</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:36:38',NULL,NULL),(18507,666,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Micella </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Micellae</em></strong>), aggregate of macro cells that make up micro-tissue</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:36:43',NULL,NULL),(18508,667,13,NULL,'<p>Figuratively, <em>“fine hair”,</em> velvety surface of Intestinal Mucosae (arranged like threads of shaggy carpet); each strand is extended further with microscopic processes, Microvilli,<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span>and becomes the brush border of the entire Epithelial Surface; increases efficiency of absorption and movement.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:43:50',44,'2025-04-09 03:35:15'),(18509,667,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Micron</em></strong> (adj.), minute parts; crumbs; Math., 1/1,000,000 </p><p><strong><em>Villus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Villi</em></strong>), fine hair, vellus hair</p><p>Figuratively, <em>“extra fine hair”</em></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:43:57',NULL,NULL),(18510,668,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Mixing</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:44:21',NULL,NULL),(18511,668,13,NULL,'<p>Actions of involuntary muscles, circular and longitudinal, that move the bolus back and forth for mixing and churning with digestive secretions.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:44:27',NULL,NULL),(18512,668,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mixtere</em></strong> (L. v.), to mingle;</p><p><strong><em>Miscens</em></strong>, (present part.), mingling</p><p>mixing and churning of digestive secretions</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:44:35',NULL,NULL),(18513,669,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Mixing</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:44:59',NULL,NULL),(18514,669,13,NULL,'<p>Gentle mixing movements are achieved by the transverse, longitudinal, oblique smooth muscle of the stomach.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:45:05',NULL,NULL),(18515,669,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mixtere</em></strong> (L. v.), to mingle;</p><p><strong><em>Miscens</em></strong>, (present part.), mingling</p><p>mixing and churning of digestive secretions</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:45:13',NULL,NULL),(18516,670,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Mixing</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:45:41',NULL,NULL),(18517,670,13,NULL,'<p>Segmental mixing pushes towards the pyloric valve and fluid chyme flows back to the body of the stomach for further churning.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:45:47',NULL,NULL),(18518,670,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mixtere</em></strong> (L. v.), to mingle;</p><p><strong><em>Miscens</em></strong>, (present part.), mingling</p><p>mixing and churning of digestive secretions</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:45:54',NULL,NULL),(18519,671,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., DENS MOLARIS; chewing teeth, 8 most posterior teeth with large crown for grinding food</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:46:18',NULL,NULL),(18520,671,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mola </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Molae</em></strong>), a millstone </p><p>metaphorically,<em> “grinding stone”</em></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:46:24',NULL,NULL),(18521,673,13,NULL,'<p>Mixing of chyme with Enzymes of Intestinal Mucosa bind to Absorptive microvilli cells </p><p>and move forward by PERISTALTIC SEGMENTAL CONTRACTIONS.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:46:56',NULL,NULL),(18522,673,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Movere </em></strong>(L. v.), to move, set in motion </p><p><strong><em>-mentum</em></strong> (suffix), result or product of the action (ex., commencement)</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:47:01',NULL,NULL),(18523,674,13,NULL,'<p>When the stomach is filled with food the Rugae flattens, volume space of stomach increases to near maximum capacity; mixing movement is achieved by the 3 directional smooth muscle of the stomach, </p><p>transverse, longitudinal, oblique&nbsp;</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:47:25',NULL,NULL),(18524,674,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Movere </em></strong>(L. v.), to move, set in motion </p><p><strong><em>-mentum</em></strong> (suffix), result or product of the action (ex., commencement)</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:47:32',NULL,NULL),(18525,675,13,NULL,'<p>Thick and slippery fluid that lubricates for easy passage of food along the tract and protect the lining of the Digestive Tract against the damaging effect of acid and digestive enzymes.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:51:33',NULL,NULL),(18526,675,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mucus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Muci</em></strong>), figuratively, <em>“phlegm from the nose”</em></p><p>Metaphor for thick digestive fluid</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:51:40',NULL,NULL),(18527,676,13,NULL,'<p>Proteoglycan, mucoid Protein, gives saliva from Mandibular and Sublingual Glands lubricating property; lack of salivary production cause mouth ulcers, infection and dental caries.&nbsp;</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:52:13',NULL,NULL),(18528,676,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mucus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Muci</em></strong>), figuratively, <em>“phlegm from the nose”</em></p><p>Metaphor for thick digestive fluid</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:52:21',NULL,NULL),(18529,676,9,NULL,'<p>comp., <strong><em><u>Muci + -in</u></em></strong></p><ul><li><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Mucus</em></strong></li><li>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-in</em></strong> (suffix), denotes protein, hormone (ex., Insulin)</li></ul>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:52:30',44,'2025-04-09 03:39:34'),(18530,677,13,NULL,'<p>Innermost lining of the digestive tract, exposed to the lumen, composed of mucus producing epithelium, moist stratified, epithelium and simple columnar epithelium.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:52:56',NULL,NULL),(18531,677,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mucosus, -a, -um </em></strong>(adj.), <em>“like phlegm”</em></p><p><strong><em>Mucus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Muci</em></strong>), figuratively, <em>“phlegm from the nose”</em></p><p>Metaphor for thick digestive fluid</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:53:02',NULL,NULL),(18532,680,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Mucousa</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:54:13',NULL,NULL),(18533,680,13,NULL,'<p>Neck Cells produce mucous, viscous and alkaline lining in the Gastric Pit; forms a mucous layer 1- 1.5 mm thick for lubrication and protection from the acidic chyme and pepsin.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:54:27',NULL,NULL),(18534,680,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mucosus, -a, -um </em></strong>(adj.), <em>“like phlegm”</em></p><p><strong><em>Mucus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Muci</em></strong>), figuratively, <em>“phlegm from the nose</em></p><p>Metaphor for thick digestive fluid</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 04:54:35',NULL,NULL),(18535,682,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., PAROTIDITIS; Inflammation of the Parotid glands, caused by a virus; presenting sign is a swollen cheek extending 