29',NULL,NULL),(18632,719,13,NULL,'<p>Viral Inflammation of the Parotid Gland</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 06:03:54',NULL,NULL),(18633,719,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Para </em></strong>(L. prep.), close to, next to, alongside </p><p><strong><em>Os</em></strong> /<strong><em>Ous</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Otes</em></strong>), ear</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 06:04:04',NULL,NULL),(18634,719,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>ParOtiditis,</em></strong></p><p><em>Viral infection of the salivary gland<span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></em></p><p><em>comp.,</em><strong><em> <u>Par + Ot- + -tid</u></em><u> + </u><em><u>-itis</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Para </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ot-</em></strong><em> derived from </em><strong><em>Otes</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-tid</em></strong> (suffix), minute part<strong><em>, </em></strong>offspring</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-itis </em></strong>(suffix), denotes inflammation</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 06:04:32',NULL,NULL),(18635,720,13,NULL,'<p>Produced by the Chief Cells as Zymogen Granules, released by Exocytosis; converted into pepsin </p><p>when exposed to the Hydrochloric acid in the lumen of the stomach; it breaks down covalent bonds of protein to smaller peptide chains</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 06:05:01',NULL,NULL),(18636,720,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Pepsis </em></strong>(Gr. n.), digestion of protein</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 06:05:07',NULL,NULL),(18637,720,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Pepsin</em></strong></p><p><em>literally, “protein for digestion of protein”</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p