</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-or</em></strong> (suffix), denotes agent of action&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 12:48:20',NULL,NULL),(18809,800,13,NULL,'<p>Serves as storage, mixing-churning and propulsion of Bolus, having limited digestion and absorption capabilities compared to the small intestine.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 12:50:43',NULL,NULL),(18810,801,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Sublingual</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 12:51:05',NULL,NULL),(18811,801,13,NULL,'<p>Mixed Alveolar-mucoid glands, more mucoid, release secretion into the floor of the oral cavity from 10- 12 ducts.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 12:51:11',NULL,NULL),(18812,801,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Sub </em></strong>(L. prep.), under, below </p><p><strong><em>Lingua </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Linguae</em></strong>), tongue&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 12:51:18',NULL,NULL),(18813,801,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>SubLingual</em></strong></p><p><em>figuratively, glands “under the tongue”</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp., </em><strong><em><u>Sub + Lingua + -al</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sub </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Lingua</em></strong> </p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-al</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 12:51:28',NULL,NULL),(18814,802,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Submandibular</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-28 12:51:55',NULL,NULL),(18815,802,13,NULL,'<p>Salivary Glands composed of more serous producing Alveoli, not mucoid; secrete from ducts at the floor of the mouth on each side of the Frenulum of the tongue&nbsp;&nbsp;</