d body temperature increases activities of immune system such as Phagocytosis and inhibit the growth of some microorganisms.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-31 03:56:14',16,'2025-05-28 00:42:24'),(19432,977,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Pyre</em></strong> (Gr. n.), fire, fever, heat, funeral fire,</p><p>\"symbolic of terrible things, rages”; poetically, “fire-blazing\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Genitor </em></strong>(L. n.), father, begetter, producer</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-31 03:56:22',NULL,NULL),(19433,977,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Pyrogen</em></strong></p><p><em>Figuratively, “generator of fire”</em></p><p><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><em>comp., </em><strong><em><u>Pyro- + -gen</u></em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>Pyro-</em></strong><em> derived from </em><strong><em>Pyre</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>-gen</em></strong><em> derived from </em><strong><em>Genitor</em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-31 03:56:33',16,'2025-05-28 00:41:52'),(19434,978,13,NULL,'<p>a net-like formation.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-31 03:56:57',NULL,NULL),(19435,978,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Reticulum </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Reticula</em></strong>), small fishing net</p><p>diminutive of <strong><em>Rete</em></strong> (L. n.), net<strong><em> </em></strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-31 03:57:06',NULL,NULL),(19436,978,9,NULL,'<p>comp., <strong><em><u>Reticula + -ar</u></em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>Reticula</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>-ar</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2024-12-31 03:57:11',16,'2025-05-28 00: