>comp.,</em><strong><em> <u>Acro- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>Soma </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-al</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Acro- </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Soma</em></strong> </p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:55:22',NULL,NULL),(19735,2556,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Acrosomal</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:55:49',NULL,NULL),(19736,2556,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Enzymes,</strong></p><p>Organic catalyst the lowers chemical resistance</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:55:58',NULL,NULL),(19737,2556,13,NULL,'<p>Primarily made up of Hyaluronidase, a digestive enzyme, that breaks down the Corona Radiata of the Oocyte.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:56:22',NULL,NULL),(19738,2556,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Acros </em></strong>(Gr. adj.), highest</p><p><strong><em>Soma</em></strong> (Gr. n.), body&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:56:28',NULL,NULL),(19739,2556,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>AcroSomal</em></strong></p><p><em>Figuratively, “highest part of the body”</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp.,</em><strong><em> <u>Acro- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>Soma </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-al</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Acro- </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Soma</em></strong> </p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-alis</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:56:37',NULL,NULL),(19740,2556,12,NULL,'<p>ACROMEGALY – SKELETAL SYSTEM</p><p>ACROMIOM PROCESS - SKELETAL SYSTEM</p>',7,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:57:05',NULL,NULL),(19741,2557,13,NULL,'<p>The circular dark pigmented area around the nipples in both male and female breasts; cebaceous secretions from these glands protect the nipple and the areola from chafing during nursing.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 11:57:28',NULL,NULL),(19742,2557,8,NULL,'<p><strong><