',NULL,NULL),(19877,2610,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Ductus</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:55:25',NULL,NULL),(19878,2610,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Deferens</strong></p><p>“Bringing away”</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:55:32',NULL,NULL),(19879,2610,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., VAS DEFERENS; the duct that originates from the Testes, <em>“channels”</em> sperms to the prelude of their final destination; joins with Seminal Vesicles, then into the ampulla called Ejaculatory Duct passing through the prostate and empty into the urethra to their earthly destiny or foiled fate.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:55:38',NULL,NULL),(19880,2610,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ductus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Ducti</em></strong>), duct</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Channels fluid</p><p><br></p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:55:42',NULL,NULL),(19881,2612,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Efferent</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:56:23',NULL,NULL),(19882,2612,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Ductules</strong></p><p>Small ducts</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:56:31',NULL,NULL),(19883,2612,13,NULL,'<p>Originate from each testis, fine ductules become extremely convoluted and coiled in the Epididymis; functions to move sperm cells out of the testes by its ciliated pseudostratified columnar epithelium.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:57:10',NULL,NULL),(19884,2612,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ex </em></strong>(L. prep.), from, out of<strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Ferre </em></strong>(L. v.), to carry;</p><p><strong><em>Ferrens </em></strong>(present part.), carrying&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 12:57:21',NULL,NULL),(19885,2612,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>EfFerrens</em></strong></p><p><em>metaphorically,</em><strong><em> </em></strong><em>“carrying away from”</em> </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Ef- + Ferrens</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&