ative of Small), sense of minor effect</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:03:46',NULL,NULL),(20081,2690,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., INTERSTITIAL CELLS; secrete Androgen from the external lining of seminiferous tubules throughout their full length.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:04:07',NULL,NULL),(20082,2690,8,NULL,'<p><strong>Leydig</strong>, F. von (1821 – 1905), German Physiologist </p><p>discovered Androgen producing cells of Seminiferous </p><p>Tubules, circa 1900-1905</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:04:14',NULL,NULL),(20083,2691,13,NULL,'<p>Cartilaginous material that attaches bone to bone; anchors organs to bones</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:04:38',NULL,NULL),(20084,2691,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ligare </em></strong>(L. v.), to tie down, to bind, fasten</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:04:43',NULL,NULL),(20085,2691,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ligament</em></strong> </p><p>Figuratively, “a binding tie”</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Liga- + -ment</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ligare </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ment</em></strong> (suffix), result or product of the action (ex., commencement)</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:04:51',NULL,NULL),(20086,2698,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Luteal</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:06:13',NULL,NULL),(20087,2698,13,NULL,'<p>If no fertilization occurs the Ovum is supported by the short Lifespan of hormonal secretions of <strong><em>Corpus Luteum</em></strong>, less than 27 days.&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:06:21',NULL,NULL),(20088,2698,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Luteus, -ea, -eum </em></strong>(L. adj.), golden-yellow- green </p><p>Swelling and secretions give Corpus Luteum color</p><p><strong><em>Luteum</em></strong>, yellowish during active period<strong><em> </em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:06:27',NULL,NULL),(20089,2699,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Luteal</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:06:46',NULL,NULL),(20090,2699,13,NULL,'