:48',NULL,NULL),(20125,2711,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Cycle</strong></p><p>Approximately, every 27 days</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:14:57',NULL,NULL),(20126,2711,13,NULL,'<p>Refers to the cyclic changes in sexually mature, non-pregnant women influenced by the </p><p>hormonal ebb and flow of the Corpus Luteum ending with Menstruation; initially prompted by the Hypothalamus.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:15:04',NULL,NULL),(20127,2711,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mens</em> </strong>(plu., <strong><em>Menses</em></strong>), month</p><p><strong><em>Menstruus, -a, -um</em></strong> (adj.), monthly</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:15:09',NULL,NULL),(20128,2712,13,NULL,'<p>The sloughing off and discharge of the blood and uterine mucus membrane at the end of </p><p>Menstrual Cycle if no fertilization of an ovum occurred.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:15:30',NULL,NULL),(20129,2712,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mens</em> </strong>(plu., <strong><em>Menses</em></strong>), month</p><p><strong><em>Menstruus, -a, -um</em></strong> (adj.), monthly</p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><strong><em>Menstruare</em></strong><em> </em>(L. v.),<em> </em>to <em>“end the month</em>”;</p><p><strong><em>Menstruatum</em></strong> (past part.), “<em>month period”</em> ended</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:15:40',NULL,NULL),(20130,2713,13,NULL,'<p>The membranous connective tissue of the Fallopian Tube attached to the Broad Ligaments.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:16:07',NULL,NULL),(20131,2713,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Mesos </em></strong><span style=\"background-color: white;\">(</span>Gr. n.), middle, halfway</p><p><strong><em>Salpinx </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Salpinges</em></strong>), trumpet-shaped tube</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:16:14',NULL,NULL),(20132,2713,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>MesoSalpinx,</em></strong></p><p><em>Figuratively, connective tissue of the middle Fallopian Tube</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp.</em><strong><em>, <u>Meso- + Salpinx</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>