le is composed of the external uro-genitalia.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:37:22',NULL,NULL),(20223,2749,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Peri </em></strong>(L. prep.), around, surrounding </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Anus</strong> (L. n.), classically, <em>“ring on finger”</em></p><p>Metaphor for the External Anal Constrictor</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:37:28',NULL,NULL),(20224,2749,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Perineum</em></strong>, </p><p>literally. <em>“around the anus”</em></p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><em>comp.</em><strong><em>,</em> <em>Peri- + -neum</em></strong> </p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Peri </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-neum </em></strong><em>derived from</em> <strong><em>Anus</em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:37:38',NULL,NULL),(20225,2756,13,NULL,'<p>Membranous fetal lining during gestation; formed from the trophoblast and uterine tissue and&nbsp;</p><p>secrete estrogen and progesterone for the maintenance of the fetus.</p><p><br></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:38:43',NULL,NULL),(20226,2756,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Placentum</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Placenta</em></strong>), Classically, <em>“flat, circular cake or bread in ancient Greece”</em> </p><p>Metaphor for the shape of extruded placenta placed on the table&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:38:48',NULL,NULL),(20227,2757,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Placenta</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:39:04',NULL,NULL),(20228,2757,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Previa</strong></p><p>Advanced</p><p><br></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:39:11',NULL,NULL),(20229,2757,13,NULL,'<p>Water flow during delivery due to a break in Placenta; literally,<em> “placenta gone ahead”</em></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-02 23:39:17',NULL,NULL),(20230,2757,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Placentum</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Placenta</em></strong>), Classically, <em>“flat, circular cake or bread in ancient Greece”</em> </p><p>Metaphor for the shape of e