 10:27:53',NULL,NULL),(20504,1813,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Action</em></strong>,</p><p>literally, “<em>doing, acting, performing”</em></p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><em>comp.,</em><strong><em> <u>Act- + -ion</u></em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>Actum</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>-ion</em></strong>, suffix, forms noun of action</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:28:03',16,'2025-06-03 01:03:50'),(20505,1814,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Activation</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:28:19',NULL,NULL),(20506,1814,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Na+ Gates,</strong></p><p>Open up during depolarization</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:28:28',NULL,NULL),(20507,1814,13,NULL,'<p>Na+ gates are closed during Resting Membrane Potential. When Depolarization is taking place Na+ gates open, and Na-K pump is activated for contraction coupling.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:28:38',NULL,NULL),(20508,1814,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>A</em>gere</strong> (v.), to do, act, perform;<strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Actum</em></strong><em> </em>(past part.), acted</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:28:49',NULL,NULL),(20509,1814,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Activation</em></strong></p><p><em>literally,</em><strong><em> </em></strong><em>“activation by</em> Na-K<em> pump” </em>in muscle membranes</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Act- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ive </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ation</u></em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>Actum</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>-ive </em></strong>(suffix), forms adj., ability</p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>-ation </em></strong>(suffix), forms noun of action</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:29:07',16,'2025-06-03 01:04:23'),(20510,1815,13,NULL,'<p>Muscles repolarizations are diminished in the presence of repeated stimulus; akin to sense of smell becoming less sensitive with prolonged exposure.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:29:27',NULL,NULL),(20511,1815,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Adaptare</em></strong> (L. v.), to fit, adjust;</p><p><strong><em>Adaptum</em></strong> (past part.), adjusted&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:29:34',NULL,NULL),(20512,1815,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Adaptation</em></strong></p><p><em>literally</em><strong><em>, </em></strong><em>“loss of sensitivity” </em>to stimulus</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Adapt- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ation</u></em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>Adaptum </em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>-ation</em> </strong>(suffix), forms noun of action; Eng., -ion(s)</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:29:48',16,'2025-06-03 01:04:42'),(20513,1817,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Adrenal</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:30:50',NULL,NULL),(20514,1817,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Gland,</strong></p><p>hormone-secreting organ</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:30:58',NULL,NULL),(20515,1817,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., SUPRARENAL GLAND; Gland located above the kidney that excretes several hormones influencing water homeostasis and the Autonomic Nervous System.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:31:06',NULL,NULL),(20516,1817,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ad</em></strong> (L. prep.), to, towards, at<strong><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Ren</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Renes</em></strong>), the kidney&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:31:26',NULL,NULL),(20517,1817,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>AdRenal</em></strong></p><p><em>figuratively, “the gland above the kidney”</em></p><p><em>comp.,</em><strong><em> <u>Ad- + Ren + -al</u></em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>Ad</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>Ren</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"><em>·            </em></strong><strong><em>-al</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:31:39',16,'2025-06-03 01:05:00'),(20518,1818,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., EPINEPHRINE; an Adrenergic Hormone, produced by the Adrenal Gland </p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">(precursor: Noreadrenaline); trigger Sympathetic Action/mode effect on Cardiovascular system, </p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">liver and adipocytes; raises heartbeat, increased blood flow to muscles, more glucose in circulation.</p><p><br></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:32:01',NULL,NULL),(20519,1818,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ad</em></strong> (L. prep.), to, towards, at<strong><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Ren</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Renes</em></strong>), the kidney&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:32:07',NULL,NULL),(20520,1818,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>AdRenaline</em></strong></p><p><em>Figuratively, hormone from “gland above the kidney</em>”</p><p><br></p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Ad- + Ren + -al + -ine</u></em></strong></p><ul><li><strong><em>Ad</em></strong></li><li><strong><em>Ren</em></strong></li><li><strong><em>-alis</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</li><li><strong><em>-ine </em></strong>(suffix), denotes basic chemical substance</li></ul>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-03 10:32:25',16,'2025-08-09 01:59:53'),(20521,3905,15,NULL,'<p><stro