ducts in the inner ear are positioned in varying angles; apparatus for </p><p>sensory balance and head position.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:20:13',NULL,NULL),(21661,2213,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Semis</em></strong> (L. n.), half</p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Circulus </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Circuli</em></strong>), a small circle </p><p>diminutive of <strong><em>Circus</em></strong>, an orbit</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:20:22',NULL,NULL),(21662,2213,9,NULL,'<p>comp., <strong><em><u>Semi- + Circul- + -ar</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Semis</em></strong> </p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Circulus</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ar</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:20:29',NULL,NULL),(21663,2214,13,NULL,'<p>Faculty of senses, not exclusive to the skin; 5 SPECIAL SENSES: Osmium, Gustatory, Optics, Tactile, Auditory.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:20:55',NULL,NULL),(21664,2214,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Sentire </em></strong>(L. v.), to feel;</p><p><strong><em>Sensum </em></strong>(past part.), felt&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:21:06',NULL,NULL),(21665,2214,9,NULL,'<p>comp., <strong><em><u>Sens- + -ation</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sensum</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ation</em></strong> (suffix), forms noun of action</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:21:13',NULL,NULL),(21666,2215,13,NULL,'<p>Function pertaining to sense receptors</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:21:33',NULL,NULL),(21667,2215,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Sentire </em></strong>(L. v.), to feel;</p><p><strong><em>Sensum </em></strong>(past part.), felt </p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 04:21:42',NULL,NULL),(21668,2215,9,NUL