 gravity and acceleration.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:25:55',NULL,NULL),(21815,2264,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Utriculus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Utriculi</em></strong>), bladder like protrusion in animals<strong><em> </em></strong></p><p>diminutive of <strong><em>Uter</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Utri</em></strong>), a leather bag</p><p>metaphor for the enlarged base of Sacculle and Utricle</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:26:03',NULL,NULL),(21816,2265,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Vagus</strong></p><p><strong>(CN X)</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:26:30',NULL,NULL),(21817,2265,13,NULL,'<p>Named for its varied, undefined and multiple function of sensory, motor, sympathetic and parasympathetic influence in the wide region of the neck, throat and chest in <em>“wandering”</em> pattern.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:26:35',NULL,NULL),(21818,2265,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Vagus, -a, -um</em></strong> (L. adj.), classically, <em>“wandering, uncertain”</em> </p><p>metaphor for CN X undefined and multiple function</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:26:41',NULL,NULL),(21819,2266,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Vallate</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:26:57',NULL,NULL),(21820,2266,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Papillae</strong></p><p>Taste buds; literally, “teats or pimples”</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:27:09',NULL,NULL),(21821,2266,13,NULL,'<p>One of the 4 types of tastes buds; distinctively, walled off by a V-shaped furrow.&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:27:15',NULL,NULL),(21822,2266,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Vallatus, -a, -um </em></strong>(adj.), walled; </p><p><strong><em>Vallum </em></strong>(plu.,<strong><em> Valla</em></strong>), wall</p><p>Figuratively, <em>“walled off by a V-shaped furrow”</em></p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:27:23',NULL,NULL),(21823,2267,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., <strong>Anterior</strong> aspect; “front of . . . “; figuratively, <em>“pertaining to the belly or womb”</em></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:27:47',NULL,NULL),(21824,2267,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Venter </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Ventres</em></strong>), belly, womb, paunch&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:27:55',NULL,NULL),(21825,2267,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ventral</em></strong></p><p><em>Figurative for anterior aspect</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp.,</em><u> </u><strong><em><u>Ventr- + -al</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ventres</em></strong> </p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-al</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:28:04',NULL,NULL),(21826,2268,13,NULL,'<p>Cerebro-Spinal Fluid filled chambers in the brain lined with Ependymal Cells that produce Cerebro-Spinal Fluid.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:28:25',NULL,NULL),(21827,2268,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Ventriculus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Ventriculi</em></strong>), small stomach; </p><p>diminutive of <strong><em>Venter</em></strong>, stomach</p><p>metaphor,<em> “small belly”</em> for ventricles in the brain</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:28:34',NULL,NULL),(21828,2268,12,NULL,'<p>VENTRICLES – CARDIOVASCULAR</p>',7,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:28:45',NULL,NULL),(21829,2269,13,NULL,'<p>A worm-like network of white mater visible in the mid-sagittal view of the Cerebellum; involved in control of posture, locomotion, and fine motor coordination</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:29:06',NULL,NULL),(21830,2269,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Vermis</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Vermes</em></strong>), worm</p><p>figurative for worm-like network of white mater in Cerebellum</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:29:11',NULL,NULL),(21831,2269,12,NULL,'<p>VERMIFORM APPENDIX -DIGESTIVE SYSTEM</p>',7,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:29:20',NULL,NULL),(21832,2270,13,NULL,'<p>26 <strong><em>Vertebrae</em></strong> of the Spinal / Vertebral column 7 cervical, 12 Thoracic, 5 Lumbar; (Sacrum, and Coccyx are not Vertebrae, but 4 to 5, separately, bones that fused)&nbsp;</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:29:54',N