lear Nerve ends in the Medulla Oblongata.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:33:09',NULL,NULL),(21846,2273,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Vestibulum</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Vestibula</em></strong>), front entrance court&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:33:16',NULL,NULL),(21847,2273,12,NULL,'<p><u>VESTIBULE</u></p>',7,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:33:33',NULL,NULL),(21848,2274,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Visceral</strong>, adj.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:33:54',NULL,NULL),(21849,2274,13,NULL,'<p>Soft internal organs; any mucoid soft connective, protective, tissue around an organ</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:34:00',NULL,NULL),(21850,2274,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Viscus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Visceres</em></strong>), soft flesh, innards </p><p>metaphorically, <em>“soft flesh”</em></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:34:06',NULL,NULL),(21851,2275,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Visceral</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:34:25',NULL,NULL),(21852,2275,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Unitary Smooth,</strong></p><p>Longitudinal muscle in digestive system, reproductive that contract for massive movement.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:34:34',NULL,NULL),(21853,2275,13,NULL,'<p>Flattened involuntary muscle sheets found in the digestive, reproductive and urinary tracts acting as one longitudinal strap throughout the system.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:34:40',NULL,NULL),(21854,2275,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Viscus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Visceres</em></strong>), soft flesh, innards </p><p>metaphorically, <em>“soft flesh”</em></p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:34:47',NULL,NULL),(21855,2276,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Visceral</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:35:05',NULL,NULL),(21856,2276,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Senses</strong></p><p>Abdominal pressure sensors</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-05 06:35:13',NULL,NULL),(21857,2276,13,NULL,'<p>Principally senses pain, stretch, and pressure to provide warning for any inflammation and swelling, abnormal growth in the abdomen.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-0