><strong>Os</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:28:29',16,'2025-04-24 01:37:13'),(23194,4069,7,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Pubis </em></strong>(plu., <strong><em>Pubes</em></strong>), classically, “<em>young man, adult, maturity”</em></p><p>Figuratively, refers to closure of Symphysis Pubis at onset of physical maturity.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:28:36',16,'2025-04-29 00:33:27'),(23195,4069,13,NULL,'<p>The pubic bone; 1 of 3 pairs fused bones collectively called, <strong><em>Os Coxae</em></strong>, <em>“bone of the pelvic basin”</em>;<strong><em> Os Pubis, Ischium, Ilium</em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:28:42',NULL,NULL),(23196,4069,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Os</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Osses</em></strong>), bone&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:28:49',NULL,NULL),(23197,4070,13,NULL,'<p>bony&nbsp;</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:29:38',NULL,NULL),(23198,4070,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Osseus </em></strong>(L. adj.), bony</p><p><strong><em>Os</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Osses</em></strong>), bone</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:29:45',16,'2025-04-29 00:33:58'),(23199,4071,13,NULL,'<p>3 miniature Auditory Ossicles of the hearing apparatus: <strong><em>Stapedius</em></strong> (stapes), <strong><em>Incus</em></strong> (anvil<strong><em>), Malleus</em></strong> (hammer)&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:30:04',16,'2025-04-24 01:26:38'),(23200,4071,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Os</em></strong> (plu.,<strong><em> Osses</em></strong>), bone</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:30:11',16,'2025-04-29 00:34:32'),(23201,4071,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Ossiculus</em></strong>,</p><p>Literally, <em>“miniature”</em> bones</p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Ossi- + -culus</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Osses</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-culus</em></strong> (L. suffix), denotes diminutive form</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:30:19',16,'2025-04-29 00:34:43'),(23202,4072,13,NULL,'<p>  a.k.a., <strong>Osteogenesis</strong>; formation of bones by Osteoblasts within in the Haversian Osteon System matrix, a network of <strong><em>Lacunae</em></strong> and <strong><em>Canaliculi</em></strong> maintaining thin circular layers of bones, called <strong><em>Lamellae</em></strong>.</p><p>  </p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:30:36',NULL,NULL),(23203,4072,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Os</em></strong> (plu.,<strong><em> Osses</em></strong>), bone</p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Facere</em></strong> (L. v.), to make<strong><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Factum </em></strong>(past part.), made<strong><em> </em></strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:30:46',16,'2025-04-29 00:35:43'),(23204,4072,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Ossification</em></strong>,</p><p>literally, <em>“formation of bone”</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Ossi- + -fic + -ation</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Osses</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-fic </em></strong><em>derived from</em><strong><em> Factum</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-ation</em></strong> (suffix) forms noun of action</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:30:54',16,'2025-04-29 00:35:55'),(23205,4073,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Precursor to Osteocytes, proliferating, Immature, germinal bone cells<strong><em> </em></strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:31:11',16,'2025-04-29 00:37:07'),(23206,4073,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Osteon </em></strong>/ <strong><em>Osteum</em></strong> (Gr. n.), bone</p><p><strong><em>Blastos </em></strong>(Gr. n.,), bud, sprout, germinal growth</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:31:20',16,'2025-04-29 00:37:18'),(23207,4073,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>OsteoBlast</em></strong>,</p><p>Literally, <em>“germinal bone cells”</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Osteo- + -Blast</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Osteon</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Blastos </em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:31:26',16,'2025-04-29 00:37:30'),(23208,4074,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Bone cells continually break down, to be renewed and remodeled according to age and stresses the bone is subjected to (body builders develop bigger bones).</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:31:43',16,'2025-04-29 00:38:18'),(23209,4074,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Osteon </em></strong>/ <strong><em>Osteum</em></strong> (Gr. n.), bone</p><p><strong><em>Clastos </em></strong>(Gr. n.,), breakdown</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:31:50',16,'2025-04-29 00:38:34'),(23210,4074,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>OsteoClast</em></strong>,</p><p>Breakdown of bone cells</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Osteo- + -Clast</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Osteon </em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Clastos </em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:31:57',16,'2025-04-29 00:38:49'),(23211,4075,13,NULL,'<p>Mature bone cells are lodged in the network <strong><em>Lacunae</em></strong> and <strong><em>Canaliculi</em></strong> within the Haversian Osteon System maintaining bone materials.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:33:59',NULL,NULL),(23212,4075,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Osteon </em></strong>/ <strong><em>Osteum</em></strong> (Gr. n.), bone</p><p><strong><em>Cytos </em></strong>(Gr. n.,), cell</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:34:07',16,'2025-04-29 00:39:22'),(23213,4075,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>OsteoCytes</em></strong>,</p><p>mature bone cells</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Osteo- + -Cyte</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Osteon</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Cytos</em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:34:13',16,'2025-04-29 00:39:33'),(23214,4076,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">a.k.a., <strong>Ossification</strong>; process of bone development from Osteoblasts to mature Osteocytes</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:34:35',16,'2025-04-29 00:40:04'),(23215,4076,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Osteon </em></strong>/ <strong><em>Osteum</em></strong> (Gr. n.), bone</p><p><strong><em>Genesis</em></strong> (L. n.), origin, beginning</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:34:43',16,'2025-04-29 00:40:14'),(23216,4076,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>OsteoGenesis</em></strong>,</p><p>Literally, <em>“bone production”</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Osteo- + Genesis</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Osteon</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Genesis</em></strong></p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:34:49',16,'2025-04-29 00:40:24'),(23217,4077,13,NULL,'<p>(Pathology) bone weakness, softness</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:35:11',NULL,NULL),(23218,4077,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Osteon </em></strong>/ <strong><em>Osteum</em></strong> (Gr. n.), bone</p><p><strong><em>Malacia </em></strong>(L. n.), weakness, softness</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:35:18',16,'2025-04-29 00:41:14'),(23219,4077,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>OsteoMalacia</em></strong>.</p><p>Literally, “<em>soft bone”</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Osteo- + -Malacia</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Osteon</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb