><strong><em>Petrosus </em></strong>(adj.), stony, rocky</p><p><em>Derived from</em></p><p><strong><em>Peter</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Petri</em></strong>), rock</p><p>Figurative for the thick portion of the Temporal Bone&nbsp;</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:47:36',16,'2025-04-29 00:59:09'),(23275,4094,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Phalangeal</strong>, adj</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:48:37',16,'2025-04-24 01:32:27'),(23276,4094,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Bones of the fingers and toes</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:48:42',16,'2025-04-29 01:00:27'),(23277,4094,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Phalanx</em></strong><em> </em>(plu., <strong><em>Phalanges</em></strong>),</p><p>classically,<strong><em> </em></strong><em>“military formation with spears and shields drawn for battle”</em>;</p><p>Metaphor for the bones of fingers and toes;</p><p>tips of Phalages look like spear heads on x-ray images</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:48:49',16,'2025-04-29 01:01:07'),(23278,4095,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Pisiformis</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:49:10',16,'2025-04-24 01:33:31'),(23279,4095,13,NULL,'<p>Small spherical bone, resembling a pea seed; 1 of 8 carpal bones: <strong><em>Pisiform, Lunate, Capitate, Hamate, Scaphoid, Trapezium, Trapezoid, Triquetrum</em></strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:49:16',NULL,NULL),(23280,4095,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Pisum</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Pisi</em></strong>), pea seed</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:49:23',16,'2025-04-29 01:01:41'),(23281,4095,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Pisiform</em></strong>,</p><p>Figuratively, “<em>pea-shaped</em>”</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp.,<u> </u><strong><em><u>Pisi- + -formis</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Pisi</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-formis</em></strong>, forms simile, shaped like</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 13:49:30',16,'2025-04-29 01:01