al bone, containing the Auditory Meatus; Origination of Temporalis Muscle</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:17:02',16,'2025-04-24 02:41:04'),(23410,4129,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Tempus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Tempores</em></strong>), time</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Metaphor for the underlying bone site of greying hair with the passage of time </p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:17:09',16,'2025-04-29 01:53:20'),(23411,4129,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Temporal</em></strong>,</p><p>The area of the head referred as <em>“temple”</em>;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Tempor- + -alis</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Tempores</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-al</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:17:16',16,'2025-04-29 01:52:44'),(23412,4130,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">A chewing muscle, originating from Squamous of Temporal B; moves the Mandible upward to bite when chewing.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:17:36',16,'2025-04-29 01:54:00'),(23413,4130,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Tempus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Tempores</em></strong>), time</p><p>Metaphor for the <em>“temple”, </em>site of greying hair;</p><p>A corruption of term “<em>Temporal”</em></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:17:44',16,'2025-04-29 01:54:13'),(23414,4130,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Temporal</em></strong>,</p><p>The <em>“temple” </em>area of the head</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Tempor- + -al</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Tempores</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-al</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:17:52',16,'2025-04-29 01:54:22'),(23415,4131,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">The Mandibular condyle articulates with the Mandibular Fossa of Temporal Bone forming the TMJ, a modified Synovial Joint with limited movement, Ellipsoid, and hinge motion; also capable of lateral deviation.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:18:11',16,'2025-04-29 01:54:50'),(23416,4131,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Tempus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Tempores</em></strong>), time</p><p>Metaphor for temple, site of greying hair</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Mandibulum</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Mandibula)</em></strong>, classically, <em>“small griding tool</em>”;</p><p>Metaphor for the chewing grinding jaw bone</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:18:23',16,'2025-04-29 01:55:08'),(23417,4131,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>TemporoMandibular</em></strong></p><p>Chewing, grinding jawbone</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>comp., <strong><em><u>Temporo- + Mandibula + -ar</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Tempores</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Mandibula</em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-ar</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:18:29',16,'2025-04-29 01:55:21'),(23418,4131,12,NULL,'<p>TEMPORALIS MUSCLE&nbsp;</p><p>TEMPOROMANDIBULAR JOINT</p><p><br></p>',6,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:18:50',NULL,NULL),(23419,4132,7,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>Thoracic</strong>, adj.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:19:07',16,'2025-04-29 01:55:56'),(23420,4132,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">The rib cage, referred to as the upper trunk and mid back Segment of the spinal column composed of the 12 vertebrae, T1 to T12</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:19:14',16,'2025-04-29 01:56:28'),(23421,4132,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Thorax </em></strong>(plu.,<strong><em> Thoraces</em></strong>) classically, <em>“breastplate”</em>, chest-</p><p>&nbsp;Upper to mid back vertebrae</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:19:2