tion for the Rectus Femoris and Vastus Medius at the anterior proximal end of Tibia.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:25:41',NULL,NULL),(23442,4138,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Tibia</em></strong> (L. n.), classically, pipe made of a hollow bone;</p><p>Metaphor for the principal leg bone</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:25:48',16,'2025-04-29 02:05:48'),(23443,4138,9,NULL,'<p>  comp., <strong><em><u>Tibia + -al</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Tibia</em></strong> </p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>-al</em> </strong>(suffix), forms adj.</p><p>  </p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:25:56',NULL,NULL),(23444,4139,15,NULL,'<p>  <strong>Tibiofibular</strong></p><p>  </p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:26:13',NULL,NULL),(23445,4139,7,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>Joints</strong></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:26:18',16,'2025-04-29 02:06:19'),(23446,4139,13,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Interosseus Membranous articulation between the diaphysis Tibia and Fibula, allowing minimal movement.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:26:24',16,'2025-04-29 02:07:17'),(23447,4139,8,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Tibia</em></strong> (L. n.), pipe made of a hollow bone;</p><p>Metaphor for the principal leg bone</p><p><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Fibula</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Fibulae</em></strong>), classically, <em>“clasp of a belt”</em>;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">bone’s semblance to the tongue of a buckle, broch or ancient safety pin.</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:26:35',16,'2025-04-29 02:08:02'),(23448,4139,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>TibioFibular</em></strong>,</p><p>Literally, “<em>leg bones”</em></p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:26:41',16,'2025-04-29 02:08:18'),(23449,4140,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Trabecular,</strong> adj.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 14:26:58',16,'2025-04-24 02:45:57'),(23450,4140,13