&nbsp;&nbsp;-ary</em></strong> (suffix), denotes function/location</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:33:36',NULL,NULL),(23646,3457,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Capillary</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:33:52',NULL,NULL),(23647,3457,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Exchange, </strong></p><p>0 &lt;–&gt; CO2 / Nutrients &lt;–&gt; Waste</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:33:59',NULL,NULL),(23648,3457,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., <strong>Difussion</strong>; Exchange of chemical substances between the inside and outside environment of arterial-venous Capillaries Anastomoses facilitated by osmotic pressure and concentration gradient.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:34:07',NULL,NULL),(23649,3457,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Capillum</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Capilla</em></strong>), hair</p><p>Metaphor for thinnest artery-veins</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:34:13',NULL,NULL),(23650,3457,9,NULL,'<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Capillary</em></strong></p><p>figuratively, functions like “<em>hair</em>”</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>comp.,</em><strong><em> <u>Capilla </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ary</u></em></strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Capilla</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ary</em></strong> (suffix), denotes function/location</p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:34:22',NULL,NULL),(23651,3459,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Capsule</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:34:48',NULL,NULL),(23652,3459,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Pressure,</strong></p><p>Within the Bowman’s capsule double wall&nbsp;</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:34:57',NULL,NULL),(23653,3459,13,NULL,'<p>The Force Pressure within the Lumen of Bowman’s Capsule is approximately 10mm Hg generated by the filtrates already in the capsule; CP opposes the pressure in the lumen of the Glomerular Capillaries</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:35:04',NULL,NULL),(23654,3459,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Capsulus</em><