art.), folded, bent</p><p>figurative for the twisting, bending, turning </p><p>configuration of proximal tubules</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:39:00',NULL,NULL),(23674,3470,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Convoluted</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:39:39',NULL,NULL),(23675,3470,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Distal Tubules,</strong></p><p>Upward part of Loop of Henle</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:39:49',NULL,NULL),(23676,3470,13,NULL,'<p>a.k.a., <strong>Distal Tubules</strong>; the descending Loop of Henle becomes Ascending Limb that bent, and twisted (convoluted), becomes Distal Tubule before it connects to the Collecting Ducts</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:39:59',NULL,NULL),(23677,3470,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Convolvere</em></strong> (v.),<strong><em> </em></strong>to fold, bend back;</p><p><strong><em>Convolutum </em></strong>(past part.), folded, bent, twisted</p><p>figurative for the twisting, bending, turning </p><p>configuration of distal tubules</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:40:08',NULL,NULL),(23678,3472,13,NULL,'<p>Outer covering of a gland, i.e. Renal outer Cortex; outer part of bones; outer layer of the brain</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:40:36',NULL,NULL),(23679,3472,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Cortex</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Cortices</em></strong>), classically, <em>“shell of nuts, coat of seeds”</em></p><p><em>Metaphor for outer layer of glands, kidney, bones, brain&nbsp;</em></p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:40:47',NULL,NULL),(23680,3474,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Cortical</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:41:17',NULL,NULL),(23681,3474,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Nephrons,</strong></p><p>plasma filtration and filtrate/solute reabsorption apparatus</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:41:24',NULL,NULL),(23682,3474,13,NULL,'<p>Nephrons, from Bowmans Capsule to the collecting duct, located in the Cortex with short Loops of Henle extend halfway into the Medulla</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-08 23:41:31',NULL,NULL),(23683,3474,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Cortex</em></strong> (plu., <