ibed</p><p>O2 – CO2 affinity to hemoglobin depending on H-content of the blood</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:49:43',NULL,NULL),(24205,2874,13,NULL,'<p>Resembling the trunk of the tree, air passageway from the Trachea divides into 2 Primary Bronchi to both lungs.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:49:59',NULL,NULL),(24206,2874,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Bronchus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Bronchi</em></strong>), windpipe</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:50:03',NULL,NULL),(24207,2878,13,NULL,'<p>Inflammation of the Bronchus and swelling of mucous membrane narrow the air ways; decreased movement of Cilia caused by profused mucous production due to irritants and infections.</p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:50:40',NULL,NULL),(24208,2878,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Bronchus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Bronchi</em></strong>), windpipe</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:50:46',NULL,NULL),(24209,2878,9,NULL,'<p>comp.,<strong><em> <u>Bronchi </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-itis</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bronchi</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-itis </em></strong>(suffix), denotes inflammation</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:50:51',NULL,NULL),(24210,2879,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Bronchopulmonary</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:51:10',NULL,NULL),(24211,2879,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Segments,</strong></p><p>Separate for each Lobe</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:51:18',NULL,NULL),(24212,2879,13,NULL,'<p>Subdivisions of lobes of the lungs: right lobe has 10, left has 9, separated by Connective Tissue, each one has separate Tertiary Bronchi and supplied by independent blood Vessels, independently supplying the lobes.</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-09 03:51:24',NULL,NULL),(24213,2879,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Bronchus</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Bronchi</em></strong>), windpipe</p><p><strong><em>Pulmon</em></strong> (plu., <strong><em>Pulmones</em></strong>), lung<strong> </