',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:15:34',NULL,NULL),(24800,4187,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em><u>Adapt- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ation</u> </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Adaptation,</em></strong></p><p><em>Literally, “Adjusting to demands”</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp.,</em><strong><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Adaptum</em></strong></p>',5,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:16:07',NULL,NULL),(24801,4188,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Adaptation</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:20:40',NULL,NULL),(24802,4188,13,NULL,'<p>The responses of muscles to depolarization-repolarization are diminished when subjected to repeated stimulus.</p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:20:45',NULL,NULL),(24803,4188,8,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Adaptare</em></strong> (L. v.), to fit, adjust;<strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Adaptum</em></strong> (past part.), fitted&nbsp;</p>',3,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:20:55',NULL,NULL),(24804,4188,9,NULL,'<p><strong><em>Adaptation,</em></strong></p><p><em>Literally, “Adjusting to demands”</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><em>comp.,</em><strong><em> <u>Adapt- </u></em></strong><u>+ </u><strong><em><u>-ation</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Adaptum</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-ation</em> </strong>(suffix), forms noun of action</p>',4,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:21:05',NULL,NULL),(24805,4189,15,NULL,'<p><strong>Alveolar</strong></p>',1,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:24:34',NULL,NULL),(24806,4189,7,NULL,'<p><strong>Changing___Volume,</strong></p><p>rise and fall of pleural air spaces </p>',2,0,NULL,16,'2025-01-10 08:24:41',NULL,NULL),(24807,4189,13,NULL,'<p>Lungs recoil with changes in pressure within the Pleural Cavity, causing changes in the Alveolar Volume, facilitated by rib movements, scapular rise and fall, diaphragmatic contraction-relaxation.</p>',3,0,NULL,1